 r←HasDotNet;buff
⍝ Returns a 1 if either .NET or .NET Framework is available and the bridge DLL was successfully loaded.\
⍝ This is what decides whether NuGet packages may be loaded: simple ones work under .NET Framework,
⍝ and a package that does need .NET says so itself, which beats refusing them all in advance.
